# Module build sources

Edit the **git repo that owns the file**, then package with the matching script. A file under `modules/<name>/common/` in a shop or ZIP is usually not in that module's git tree.

Scripts live in `C:\Users\Windows 10\projects\prestashop\` (parent of the module repos). Run them from that directory. Each `build_*_module.sh` calls `build_module.sh`.

| Build | Source repo | Package dir | Injected at build |
|---|---|---|---|
| `build_amazon_module.sh` | `Prestashop-Amazon` | `amazon` | `common/` + `classes/seller_partner/` |
| `build_amazon_saas_module.sh` | `Prestashop-SAAS-Module` | `amazonsaas` | `classes/seller_partner/` only (`common/` is **not** replaced) |
| `build_cdiscount_module.sh` | `PrestaShop-Cdiscount` | `cdiscount` | `common/` |
| `build_fnac_module.sh` | `PrestaShop-Fnac` | `fnac` | `common/` |
| `build_mirakl_module.sh` | `Prestashop-Mirakl-v2` | `mirakl` | `common/` |
| `build_rakuten_france_module.sh` | `Prestashop-Priceminister` | `priceminister` | `common/` |
| `build_spartoo_module.sh` | `Prestashop-Spartoo` | `spartoo` | `common/` |
| `build_so_colissimo_flexibilite_module.sh` | `PrestaShop-Soflexibility` | `soflexibilite` | `common/` |
| `build_so_colissimo_liberte_module.sh` | `PrestaShop-Soliberte` | `soliberte` | `common/` |
| `build_sonice_etiquetage_module.sh` | `PrestaShop-SoNice-Etiquetage` | `sonice_etiquetage` | `common/` |
| `build_sonice_pro_module.sh` | `PrestaShop-Sonice-Pro` | `sonicepro` | `common/` |
